<title>PHILIPPINES: Bacnotan Cement says Q1 net up by 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Bacnotan Cement says Q1 net up by 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bacnotan Cement Corp said on Wednesday it posted a 45 percent increase in net income for the first quarter ending September 30 to 57.6 million pesos.</p>
</text>
